      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Thrombosis of the internal jugular vein (IJV) is uncommon. It usually responds to conservative medical treatment. We describe a case of IJV thrombosis in a 31-year-old man. The patient was successfully treated with IJV ligation after conservative therapy had failed."},
